  "goodToKnow": "Der Gurt is a strap or belt, especially der Sicherheitsgurt (seat belt): sich anschnallen, den Gurt anlegen. West Germany introduced die Gurtpflicht for front seats in 1976 and fines for not wearing one in 1984. Der Gürtel is the belt for trousers: den Gürtel enger schnallen (to tighten one's belt). In karate, der schwarze Gürtel is the black belt. Plural: die Gurte."
